# / minimap). Those anchors are the accurate side (total-grid bias median +0, MAE 7.3-8.1 vs settled
# truth) but their result was never fed BACK into the tiers, so the leftover stayed unclaimed: aisha
# 2502 R5 has q1/q3/q4/q5 cells EXACTLY on truth and a total grid of 102 (truth 103), yet the tiers
# only claim 84 — and the 18 orphaned cells are precisely the red the engine reports as 2 (truth 21).
# So: once the anchors have settled, re-enter with the anchored total as a SOFT total_grid_target and
# let the existing _fit_grids_to_total_target DP redistribute. The DP already knows which tiers are
# pinned (exact cells / tool avg) and only scales the rest, so a late round where the low tiers are
# locked hands the whole remainder to gold/red (the design gates), while an early round where nothing
# is locked spreads it across all tiers proportionally — which is what stops it from dumping 42 orphan
# cells onto a red whose truth is 24 (5609 R1). SOFT (no hard note) so no combo is ever rejected.
